Inspection well concrete module production and processing equipment Zhengzhou well wall briquetting module equipment introduction:
Zhengzhou YiXin is the domestic concrete inspection well module brick machine equipment, inspection of well building block machinery, well wall module machinery professional manufacturers, from semi-automatic to fully automated production line.
After many years of practice and development, it now has excellent quality, which mainly produces hydraulic, mobile and fully automated inspection well series equipment and supporting devices.
Inspection well concrete module production and processing equipment Zhengzhou well wall brick module equipment assembly site:
The characteristics and advantages and advantages of inspection well concrete module production and processing equipment Zhengzhou well wall brick module equipment:
It is widely used for new masonry materials such as coal, heat, water, electricity, gas and other municipal underground structures.
For example, all kinds of inspection wells, rainwater vents, ditches, septic tanks and small structures, and bridge wing walls of drainage and water storage facilities.
The advantage of using the concrete module to build the inspection well is that the upper and lower parts of the module are concave groove structures, and the combined masonry to form a chain.
The shear resistance of the well wall is far superior to the masonry form of flat friction masonry.
The module is a hollow structure, after the combination of masonry longitudinal porous porous commuting, lateral porous porous turbulence, porous porous porous poring, the formation of the cast concrete mesh structure, played a role of secondary reinforcement and waterproofing.
The module has a grooves in the vertical and horizontal manner, and the lateral rebar and the longitudinal interpolation correspondingly improve the overall strength of the structure.
In addition to the use of concrete inspection well module masonry to build the inspection well, drainage well is not prone to collapse, sinking, water leakage and other phenomena, well wall module mechanical performance is stable, simple operation, forming size standards.
The intelligent control is equipped with data input, output device one-button touch liquid crystal display to monitor the whole process, to achieve the ideal man-machine dialogue, automatic analysis of the material, density operation, safety logic control and fault diagnosis system.
The mechanical hydraulic system adopts single-cylinder Hydraulic Hydraulic, Conveying, Double-cylinder Hydraulic and Conveying.
The independent hydraulic integration station avoids the impact of host vibrations on the hydraulic system, thereby ensuring the reliability of the hydraulic system's work.
The concrete inspection well module briquetting machine briquetting machine material box moving molded rise, the storage box door is closed, the automatic conveying board, all completed independently by the hydraulic system, so as to reduce the wear and maintenance of the machinery.
Concrete inspection well module brick machine equipment using imported computers, electrical appliances, sealing hydraulic parts, quasi-guaranteed equipment comprehensive performance is stable and reliable.
Well-walled wall module mechanical excitation platform adopts the overall plate and steel, and the countertop line is cut into no welding point, so that the filler box is freely oscillation guidance, which fully reduces mechanical wear.
The mold load is reduced, the packing and two-in-one encryption amplitude are used, all-synchronized and fully synchronized to ensure the vibrating effect.
Well-walled wall module mechanical excitation machinery, computer automatic control amplitude according to the raw material cost-effective adjustment amplitude, no wear brake, so as to extend the service life and reduce costs.
The mechanical automatic control and manual control function of the well wall wall module is a dual function.
