Chongqing secondary vocational school pilot modern Apprenticeship admission is the quasi-employee-Xinhua
Yesterday, the reporter learned from the Municipal Education Commission that this year, the city will pilot the "Modern Apprenticeship" talent training model in 60 secondary vocational schools, the students who accept the pilot training at the same time have the status of Apprenticeship at the same time, and will be pre-recorded as unit employees by the pilot enterprises after enrollment.
According to the requirements of the Municipal Education Commission to standardize the admission and enterprise employment procedures of secondary vocational schools, clarify the dual status of secondary vocational school students and enterprise prospective employees of apprentices, in accordance with the principle of two-way selection, apprentices, schools and enterprises to sign a three-party agreement, for apprentices who have not reached the age of 18 at the age of 16, an agreement must be signed by apprentices, guardians, schools and enterprises to determine the rights and interests of each party and the specific positions, teaching content, rights and interests.
Pilot schools are encouraged to jointly carry out pre-post training and transfer training for enterprise employees in the form of modern apprenticeships with cooperative enterprises.
Pilot schools should reform the talent training model.
Schools and enterprises jointly design talent training programs to jointly formulate professional teaching standards, curriculum standards, post standards, corporate master standards, quality control standards and corresponding implementation plans.
The pilot training system is a pilot cycle, the internship time of the students in the enterprise is determined according to the professional personnel training program, which is generally 6 months.
According to the characteristics of different majors, a master can bring 2 to 5 apprentices to form a learning group to ensure that students are proficient in the skills required for each rotating training position.
According to the arrangement, from 2016 to August 2019, the city has identified 60 modern apprenticeship pilots at the municipal level in three batches, each with a total of about 50 pilots, with a total of about 3,000 students (apprentices).
In accordance with the principle of piloting and then gradually advancing from point to surface, we will explore the establishment of a long-term mechanism for the joint enrollment, joint training and integrated education of schools and enterprises, so as to effectively improve students' post skills and improve the employment rate and employment quality of students.
