China children's center will hold a series of activities to let the children "high-tech" over the "June 1" - Xinhua
BEIJING, May 20 /PRNewswire-of-the-art (Xinhua) -- A reporter learned from the China Children's Center on the 20th that from May 28 to June 1, around the "June 1st" Children's Day, the China Children's Center plans to hold a series of activities such as children's maker experience, children's visual arts festival, and parent-to-child book carnival, so that children can spend the "June 1" in the charm of cutting-edge science and technology.
It is understood that the activities held by the China Children's Center during this year's â€œJune 1st Children's Dayâ€ include the â€œCarriage Coolâ€ children's future learning carnival, the first children's visual arts festival, the â€œbook carnivalâ€ event, and â€œthe whole family loves to readâ€ .
Li Zhongming, deputy director of the China Children's Center, said at the "June 1st" Children's Day media ventilation meeting held on the 20th that the "Love Family Chuang Cool" children's future learning carnival is the key activity of this year's China Children's Center.
The activities focus on combining social innovation with the family's personal creativity, experiencing various innovative educational activities through the participation of children and families, so that innovative practices have become the cultural genes of the mass family, and make "hands-on" a new learning and lifestyle for the majority of families.
It is reported that there are dozens of cutting-edge scientific and technological experience content such as "Creators" children's future learning carnival including "bean fruit maker" experience activities, the anniversary celebration of the old cattle children's exploration museum and "exploration of the whole family's love 童猌猌猒 through the 61" activities, the VR national experience plan, and the interactive workshop of the "maker tribe".
