Drawing strength from the party's 100-year history of struggle
According to the unified arrangement of the provincial party committee, on the morning of December 10, Yang Haodong of the Standing Committee of the Provincial Party Committee and the Propaganda Department of the Provincial Party Committee made an interactive speech at the Ma Yueshan Video Wenchuang Garden, deeply studied and implemented the spirit of the Sixth Plenary Session of the Nineteenth Central Committee of the Communist Party of China, learned and implemented the spirit of General Secretary Xi Jinping's important instructions and instructions for Hunan's important speech, and learned to implement the spirit of the 12th Party Congress.
Yang Haodong from the three aspects of ideal belief and original mission, self-revolution and youth party, party leader and party theory, combined with his own understanding and personal experience, in-depth and comprehensive and systematic interpretation of the core essence and practical requirements of the spirit of the plenum.
He pointed out that it is necessary to combine the spirit of the plenum and the spirit of General Secretary Xi Jinping's important instructions and instructions on Hunan's important speeches and the spirit of the provincial party congress, integrate and learn, strengthen the ideological consciousness of defending the "two establishments" and achieve the "two maintenances" of ideological consciousness, political self-consciousness and action consciousness, and unswervingly follow the direction guided by General Secretary Xi Jinping.
In the interactive exchange link, grass-roots cadre representatives, business representatives, youth representatives on the relationship between the three historical resolutions, how to understand the decisive significance of the "two establishments", how to grasp the guidance of cultural enterprises, how young people in the new era to draw strength from the history of the centenary of the Communist Party, Yang Haodong with a common language, vivid examples one by one to answer one by one.
The number of university graduates in the Beijing area is expected to reach 168,000 in 2022 - Xinhua
BEIJING, Dec. 11 (Xinhua) -- The reporter learned from the video conference on employment and entrepreneurship of Beijing college graduates recently jointly held by the Beijing Municipal Education Commission and the Beijing Municipal Bureau of Human Resources and Social Security that the number of college graduates in Beijing is expected to reach 26.8 million in 2022, an increase of 16,000 compared with last year.
The relevant person in charge of the Beijing Municipal Bureau of Human Resources and Social Security said that the employment of Beijing college graduates will be deployed to strengthen supply and demand matching, strengthen policy support, broaden employment channels, ensure difficult assistance, support innovation and entrepreneurship, and improve service efficiency.
The reporter learned that the Beijing Municipal Bureau of human resources and social security will build a practical platform to increase the supply of jobs, take the initiative to contact 40 college graduates workplace experience base, visit the employing units, integrate demand information and job information; focus on "six batches", that is, to broaden the recruitment of public institutions, broaden the recruitment of state-owned enterprises, broaden the recruitment of grass-roots projects, broaden the number of conscripts, broaden the number of employment trainees, and broaden the number of employment-driven employment.
