Xinhua all-media + 丨 Beijing Youth Ice Hockey League to ignite the enthusiasm of the Winter Olympics
On December 11, Pang Yaotian (middle), a player of the Beijing Dreaming ING team, shot in the game.
On the same day, in the 2021-2022 season, the Beijing Youth Ice Hockey Club League will continue to compete at the major ice rinks in Beijing.
The league is divided into the regular season and the playoffs, the age group of participating athletes is U6 to U18, and the group setting is divided into competitive groups and selection groups, attracting nearly 3,600 players from the city's 256 teams.
After more than ten years of development, the Beijing Youth Ice Hockey Club League has now become a platform for Beijing's youth ice hockey enthusiasts to compete in technology, Cantonese friends, and send excellent players to the Beijing youth ice hockey team and youth team.
The league gives full play to the leading role of the event in the youth ice hockey movement in Beijing, igniting the enthusiasm for ice hockey in the Winter Olympics, and laying the foundation for the development of Beijing's ice hockey in the post-Winter Olympic period.
The girl as an arrow as a target for her sister's fundraising: "It's okay to think that it's brute-grain wounds" - Xinhua.com
A girl stood in front of a large wooden plank with the words "human meat target, ten yuan and an arrow".
Yesterday morning, a "Hangzhou girl Gandang 'arrow target' for the sister to raise donations" photos burst the circle of friends.
The photo shows that a girl in Wulin Square in Hangzhou is standing in front of a large wooden board that is slightly taller than a person, with the words "human meat target, ten yuan and an arrow" written on the board, indicating that passers-by can be used to shoot after payment.
This behavior has aroused heated discussion among netizens.
Last night, the person in charge of Propaganda in the lower city branch of the Hangzhou Municipal Public Security Bureau confirmed to the Beijing News reporter that the police confirmed that the girl had made such excessive actions for her sister's fundraising, but this kind of behavior was not worthy of promotion, after warning, the girl had left the local police station yesterday.
The girl's street "arrow target" fund-raisers were admonished
In the online picture, a long-haired girl stands in front of a large wooden board with a black ink written on the words "human meat target, ten yuan and one arrow", and she wrote her bank's account and WeChat and Alipay account in front of the other board.
This image caused controversy after going online.
Some netizens believe that this move is a "eyeball begging behavior", there are also many netizen sympathies for it.
â€œWhen we patrol around 10 a.m. on the 23rd to the side of the plaza, there were already a lot of onlookers.â€
In an interview with the local media at the Tianshui police station near the scene of the incident, there were two girls at the stall, both about 20 years old, dressed in youthful beauty.
Among them, the girl who is a "human meat target" has been crying and asking passers-by to play this game; the other girl is cheering on the side, saying that her friend's sister has leukemia, and now she urgently needs the cost of surgery.
"We got in touch with the local police in Guizhou and learned that the girl was collecting donations for her sister's leukemia treatment."
Last night, the person in charge of the publicity department of the lower city branch of the Hangzhou Municipal Public Security Bureau told the Beijing News reporter that the girl's name was Ji Jiali to raise funds for her sister Ji Jiayan.
However, because the treatment still requires more than 30 million costs, it was impossible to think of a good way to raise funds before this behavior was made.
He said that in the whole process, the two girls as a target, one is responsible for playing the hand, but did not participate in the whole process did not find someone to shoot arrows, but someone onlookers and took a photo posted on Weibo.
After the police were verified by the public security department, the use of bows and arrows does not belong to the scope of control.
The person in charge said, "Do not advocate the use of this eye-catching fund-raising way."
After being warned by the police station, she left the police station.
