What’s the hottest in 2021?
The Tokyo Olympics, of course.
Do you think that only an Olympic athlete can win an award?
Some time ago, there was an article entitled "The project manager who can impact the gold medal of the Olympic project" article is very hot, it is mentioned that the project manager in a large number of projects, it is absolutely possible to take the lead, no one can match: moving bricks, business trips, staying up late is the daily life of the project manager, fighting fire, carrying pot, and apologizing.
It seems to be a funny article, but it also shows the daily poignancy of project managers, which represents the inability of the current project management work.
The people who are engaged in project management have also gradually chosen to use some actions to get themselves out of the difficulties at work.
Judging from the number of PMP (internationally certified project management professional qualifications) that rises every year, more and more project management practitioners are learning to improve their project management capabilities.
As of September 2019, there have been nearly 600,000 PMP® applicants nationwide, about 420,000 PMP® certifications and about 420,000 PMP® certifications, and about 300,000 valid licensees, accounting for 31.2% of the world’s total PMP® certificates.
In the past 10 years, the number of PMP licensees has increased year by year, which shows that more and more project managers realize that it is no longer advisable to do things by simply copying the "old old experience" in the past, and the rapidly changing working environment allows us to learn and stand on the shoulders of scientific giants to explore the way forward.
However, with PMP, can we ensure that the project management work is unimpeded?
Many project management beginners said that by studying relevant courses such as PMP/IPMP, they can systematically grasp the top ten fields of project management and the relevant knowledge points such as the five major process groups, but the real project management work is still confused.
A lot of project managers often feedback the following problems: project management awareness is not in place, relying solely on personal experience, empty project management theory, do not know how to practice; lack of systematic project management process system support, the work can not be landed, project estimation is not allowed, the control sensitivity is poor, the project is delayed; the division of labor of members is not clear, the team in the "old oil bar" do not know how to deal with cross-departmental assistance communication is not smooth, the project is difficult to promote...
Therefore, focusing more than ten years in the field of product innovation and R&D and management, it has helped many excellent enterprises to cultivate a large number of key R&D talents such as product managers and project managers, and has obtained the honorary titles of "Chinese enterprise R&D and management personnel training demonstration base".
R&D project manager special training camp online course This is an online fragmented way of learning, combined with many R&D enterprise combat cases, tools and methods, to help you master the necessary knowledge and standard actions of the project manager, embarked on the advanced path of their own project management.
This is also an opportunity for enterprises to use lower costs and less investment to promote the training process of project managers and lead to efficient operation results for enterprises.
This course is not only by the team of Zhongtian Huaxia experts (the original Huawei research and development management team), combined with international advanced project management methodology and many well-known enterprise real business scenarios to provide an in-depth professional explanation of the content of the course.
It will also provide scientific and practical management tools and methods, and a wealth of template forms to help students to translate the content of their learning into specific tasks after class.
