On the eve of the "double twelve" to advocate rational consumption to consumers - Economic Observer Network - Professional financial news website
In this year's "double eleven" carnival national online payment business transactions amounted to 1.77 trillion yuan, compared with previous years and a new high.
There are a wide variety of red envelopes, eye-catching live goods once again let consumers benefit, this consumption boom on the one hand makes people lament that the national consumption power is becoming more and more strong, on the other hand also had to calm down and think about the impact of consumerism on society and contemporary mainstream consumer groups.
On the eve of the arrival of the "Twenty-two", Jiexin Consumer Finance Co., Ltd. (hereinafter referred to as "Jiexin") issued a rational consumption initiative to remind the vast number of users, especially young people, to establish a good sense of consumption and consumption habits, and to refuse blind consumption and overconsumption.
According to the "Consumer financial literacy survey and analysis report" report released by the People's Bank of China this year, the national consumer financial literacy index was 66.81, an increase of 2.04 compared with 2019.
In general, China's residents perform well at the level of financial consumption, but they show large differences in different aspects of financial behavior and skills, and it is necessary to further improve the level of basic financial knowledge.
The level of financial literacy of the elderly and young people is relatively low, "one old and one young" will continue to be the focus of financial education; Nielsen's release of "China's young people's debt status report" and CCTV financial release of the "2019-2020 Chinese youth consumption report" shows that the younger generation has huge consumption potential, credit consumption has become an important way to upgrade consumption, 86.6% of young people are in the use of credit products
As a licensed consumer financial institution, we are committed to helping people build a happy life with high-quality and intimate services, advocating that consumers establish a good and correct concept of consumption, and actively respond to the call of supervision to enhance the rational consumption consciousness of consumers, especially young people.
In the past few years, the company has continued to carry out all-round and diversified financial knowledge popularization activities for youth groups, including college students, and to rationally guide the consumption needs of young groups through various forms such as cooperation with top domestic universities to launch innovation and practice competitions, helping them to establish a rational consumption concept, rationally planning consumer demand, and thus contributing to the accumulation of life wealth.
On the occasion of the arrival of Twelfth, Jixin reminded all consumer friends to establish a reasonable sense of consumption and a correct view of money, resist blind consumption and overconsumption, and avoid the misunderstanding of consumer borrowing, so as not to affect personal credit and future economic life.
It is necessary to plan in advance during consumption and repay on time.
If it is overdue, the overdue records will be recorded in the personal credit report, which may have a negative impact on economic life such as buying a car and buying a house in the future.
At the same time, in the enjoyment of financial products and services, you should also choose formal institutions and channels, and pay attention to check whether the relevant institutions have business qualifications.
In the future, with its mature and reliable consumer financial system and constantly updated and iterative financial products in the future, it will provide consumers with services that are more relevant to their needs and diversity, continue to help the public improve the level of financial knowledge, help consumers cultivate the concepts of rational consumption and moderate borrowing, and be a trusted consumer financial partner for life.
