Let the spirit of the university and the spirit of the times rejuvenate - Xinhua
The so-called "university spirit" refers to a series of school-running concepts and value pursuits formed by a university for a long time in the process of development, which is the soul of the university.
From ancient times to the present, the spirit of the university is crucial to the development of politics, economy, culture, science and technology, society, as well as the progress of a nation.
Since the birth of the world's first university in the modern sense, the university has shouldered a unique mission that is different from other social organizations, for China's universities, rising in the autumn of national crisis, its spirit is deeply affected by the traditional culture and the changes of the times, advocating the value concept of "Mingdeji, repairing the rule" and the patriotic responsibility of "learning a strong country".
At present, the trend of informatization and internationalization of higher education is becoming more and more obvious, educational competition, scientific and technological competition and talent competition on a global scale are intensifying, and the cause of higher education as an important "supply side" is facing unprecedented opportunities and challenges.
In particular, the overall plan to comprehensively promote the construction of world-first-class universities and first-class disciplines shows China's confidence and determination to move from a big country of higher education to a powerful country in higher education at the same time, it also puts forward higher requirements for the development of the university.
How to strive to be among the world's first-class ranks in a relatively short period of time, on the basis of there is still a certain gap to accelerate the establishment of a number of world-class universities and a number of world-class disciplines to achieve "curve overtaking"?
In addition to the firm goal of self-confidence, the path of self-confidence, self-confident ability, colleges and universities should also give full play to the three advantages: one is the latecomer advantage, through the continuous introduction of overseas outstanding academic talents, learning to learn from the advanced experience of world-class universities, to achieve a significant improvement in the academic level and the quality of the school; the second is the cultural advantage, inherit the wisdom of the Chinese civilization accumulated in 5,000 years, carry forward the development of excellent traditional culture, in order to maintain the strength, shape the brand and enhance the image.
In particular, it is necessary to realize that it is impossible to build a world-class university, and each school must show its personality and characteristics while giving full play to its advantages.
The characteristics of running the school should not only have common Chinese characteristics, but we must also reflect their own unique target positioning, school-running traditions and resource endowments.
As far as Zhejiang University is concerned, we pay attention to highlighting the characteristics of innovation and entrepreneurship talent training, building an integrated educational environment for the integration of science and education and the combination of schools and enterprises to form a full-chain entrepreneurship education ecosystem; the other is to highlight the characteristics of interdisciplinary agglomeration, promote the optimization and adjustment of the disciplinary system, create an interdisciplinary institutional environment, and actively cultivate interdisciplinary emerging disciplines and landmark cross-cutting achievements; the third is to highlight the school system and the characteristics of social services.
In this process, it is particularly important to always adhere to the spirit of the university, so that the spirit of the university and the spirit of the times resonate.
For Zhejiang University, the school motto of â€œsoccupying for innovationâ€ and â€œindustrious learning, cultivation, discernment and solidityâ€ and â€œHaina River,â€œHenna River, Kai Zhen Houdeâ€ , the opening of the people before the people, and the countryâ€ constitute the latest expression system in the spirit of Zhejiang University.
This is an important guarantee that the school adheres to the correct direction of running the school, and constantly accumulates a cultural height and consolidates spiritual strength, with rich connotation and far-reaching significance.
Among them, â€œHaina Riverâ€ emphasizes the spirit of openness and inclusiveness, which is reflected in the mind of â€œthe talents in the worldâ€, which is manifested in the high-quality concept of absorbing the world's famous schools and educating people; the â€œHenna Riverâ€ emphasizes the spirit of seeking the truth, which means that the university should pursue the truth at the same time, and should accept the spirit of virtue, and the spirit of reform and innovation.
This series of spiritual concepts and value pursuit is the soul of Zhejiang University for 120 years.
"He who hears in silence, and the enlightened is seen unshapeable."
China's colleges and universities should be further based on the overall situation of the cause of socialism with Chinese characteristics, deeply grasp the orientation and historical mission of the higher education cause, and accelerate the construction to become a world-class university.
At the same time, adhering to humanistic care and independence and freedom, so that the spirit of the university and the zeitgeist and the spirit of the nation stir each other, so as to provide inexhaustible impetus for the realization of the country's prosperity and national rejuvenation and the realization of the common ideals of mankind.
