By the time the NFT sprang up, a new concept emerged in the crypto community.
In 2021, a blockchain game called “Axie Infinity” made a huge impact in the Southeast Asian region, and some residents who lost their jobs due to the epidemic began to earn a stable income in the game.
"Axie Infinity" is a pet development game based on blockchain technology, which combines a variety of NFTs, and currently has the highest transaction volume of NFT projects, with more than 3 billion US dollars so far.
According to TokenTerminal data, Axie Infinity earns more than $8.2 million a day.
On August 6 this year, Axie Infinity officially announced that it had more than 1 million daily active users.
"Axie Infinity" fiery will pass a new "palytoearn" model to more people, through the help of blockchain and smart contracts, the player is no longer a single character, in addition to the fun and economic benefits from the game, you can also participate in the governance of the game ecology.
This kind of subjectivity is not granted by the game’s producers, but guaranteed by blockchain technology.
