The initial registration of the first-level cost, the problem of continuing education, have you encountered it?
Late registration should provide not less than 30 hours of continuous education in the last year Re-registration should provide nearly 4 years not less than 120 hours of continuing education certificate The re-registration should provide no less than 30 hours of continuing education in every 1 full year
Cost Engineer's Continuing Education Cost Standards
The cost engineer who participates in the continuous education of the network must pay the study fee to the various management agencies at the time of registration, and the general standard is 300 yuan / person year (including the unified teaching materials for continuing education);
The cost of 30 academic elective courses is 300 yuan / person year.
Compulsory courses for 30 academic hours and 30-hour elective courses cost 600 yuan / person year (including unified teaching materials for continuing education).
(A) to participate in the middle price association or the provincial and departmental management agencies to organize the network of registered cost engineers to continue education and learning, according to the online study of courseware records to calculate the school hours;
(B) to participate in medium-price associations or provincial and departmental management agencies to organize centralized face-to-face training and various types of training courses, seminars, etc., every half-day can be identified 4 academic hours;
(C) to participate in medium-price associations, provincial and departmental cost engineers, cost officers continue to teach, every half a day can be identified 10 school hours;
(D) to participate in medium-price and provincial-level project research, industry standard preparation, textbook preparation, each annual recognition of 30 academic hours;
Participate in the preparation of teaching materials and propositions, questions, and evaluation papers for the national cost engineer's practice qualification examination, which can be recognized for 30 academic hours per year;
(7) professional papers and works related to the cost of the project under his personal signature and published (subject to the official publication number).
12 academic hours per 10,000 words for published works;
Published papers in state-by-country publications for 8 credit hours, papers published in provincial-level journals 5 credit hours per thousand words, papers published in city-level journals 3 credit hours per thousand words;
(9) Participate in open training for the community (except for the general management and skills training of enterprises), which can be recognized every half-day, 4 academic hours can be recognized every half-day, up to a maximum of 30 academic hours per year can be recognized.
Cost engineer network to continue the education and learning process
After the registrar receives the fee, the identity of the trainees is opened, and the cost engineer can enter the online education classroom with a username and password.
The students learn through on-demand courseware, question-and-answer questions, and online discussions.
If you forget the password, the username and password is incorrect when you log in, and if you can't log in to the study, please contact the registered institution, and the registrar can help to modify the student's password (but you can't modify the user's name), use its modified password to log in again.
