What is Red Whiskey?
Everyone's hobbies are different, some people like collecting, some people like food, of course, some people like wine tasting, red whiskey is one of the best-selling scotch whiskies in various countries, and red-platent whiskey has won the gold medal of the International Foreign Wine Competition.
Every bottle of red-plated whiskey has a unique taste, but if you don't know how to taste it, it doesn't ruin its melody.
So how do you drink Red Whiskey?
The small series is a brief introduction for everyone.
Red Whiskey Drinks:
The red-plated whisky is composed of about 35 Scotch whiskies with a strong aromatic and traditional scotch whiskies with a sweet and smoky aroma.
The inlet is fresh, with a slightly vanilla and a strong smoky malt taste.
The wine can be added to the ice, or mixed with your favorite drink.
In order to adapt to the tastes of the Chinese people, bubble drinks such as red-plated whiskies + cola or sprites or novelty have become an enduring fad.
These sweetened drinks, in addition to neutralizing and sour, can visually give people pleasure, add drinks, to dilute the effect of changing the taste.
Red-plated whiskey + sliced lemon + sugar (sugar sugar is also possible), is the most authentic and traditional way to drink.
The Authentic Red Fangwei tastes a little sour, the addition of sugar can neutralize the sour taste, lemon will bring a fresh aroma to the wine, of course, the sweet acidity can be blended according to your personal taste.
The above three are the best way to drink red whiskey, we can be used as a reference to try, I hope the introduction can help everyone.
Educated thinking: how to make the "student hegemony" and "student slag" get their own place - Xinhua
Lanzhou Jiaotong University three students wrote a letter to the school leaders, reflecting the confusion about the university exam, and put forward to improve the difficulty of the exam, change the test question type, so that the exam can truly reflect the student's actual level of appeal.
Indeed, for a long time, the university exam has been a "hot topic".
On the university campus, the students come from all over the world, the level of ability is different, coupled with different levels of learning, the situation of learning is very different.
For groups with such multiple characteristics to assess, there are different feelings, it is inevitable.
Of course, if there is a single test question type and a high repetition rate, and the problem is too simple, it will inevitably cause a completely different feeling.
Students who don't work hard may be able to pass the pre-examination concentrated assault, and if they think of other methods, it is possible to achieve a multiplier effect.
In this way, the emergence of "student slag" usually does not invest can also pass, and even get a high score; "student hegemony" usually never dropped out of class, homework, notes are as good, the exam is not much higher than the "strange status quo".
In this way, the students of Lanzhou Jiaotong University reflect that the problems existing in the university examination are not unfounded, and I believe that this situation does not exist only Lanzhou Jiaotong University.
In this sense, I would like to commend the three students who have written letters.
In fact, people who have gone to the university are well aware that it is not uncommon to rush to prepare for the exam and find a variety of ways to "take" the test questions from the teacher, strive to draw the scope of the exam, and get the "key tutoring" before the exam is not uncommon, and it's not uncommon to take a small copy in the exam.
In the author's view, as a teaching quality assessment guide, measuring the qualification of a university exam depends on the teacher's comprehensive grasp of teaching and learning, as well as scientific propositions on this basis.
Entering the undergraduate level of the university, the profession begins to be subdivided, and many professional courses are based on basic knowledge.
Undoubtedly, whether to fully grasp the basic knowledge points of a discipline is the content to be examined by the university examination.
Undergraduate knowledge is basically the basic theory and basic common sense, from the point of view of knowledge, the space for change is not large, basically fixed.
Just as a teacher said, "20 years ago, the basic knowledge of university mathematics, is still learning, or the focus."
However, the knowledge point is basically unchanged, and it does not mean that the test question type is single and the test questions are repeated.
In many universities, the exam will generally form a question group, and then by the senior teachers of the discipline to form a test paper, the examination paper is also the participation of all the teachers who bear the subject, so as to overcome the duplication of test questions to a certain extent to a certain extent.
However, in order to draw up a set of test questions that are in line with the actual situation of teaching and learning, according to the overall situation of the student's learning, it is easy to show the normal distribution, and it is also necessary to comprehensively grasp the teaching situation and comprehensively analyze the degree of students' learning, so that the test proposition has a dynamic grasp of the difficulty and problem type, which can not only highlight the basic knowledge inspection, but also take into account the ability to investigate, and at the same time carry out an innovative design.
The exam is the baton of university education, what kind of examination, students will have the corresponding test preparation program, in the long run, will affect the effectiveness of university education.
For the student's recommendation letter, Lanzhou Jiaotong University attaches great importance to it and has deployed a rectification program in the whole school.
All teaching units are required to organize teachers to carry out self-inspection of seminars and course completion exams, formulate examination paper propositions and related systems, and at the same time strengthen the supervision and inspection of examination paper propositions and audit links, refine performance evaluation, and strengthen the comprehensive assessment of all aspects of curriculum teaching.
From the mechanism to solve the problem of a single type of test, the problem of repetition of the problem is the problem that universities need to deal with, of course, they need to introduce the corresponding system, but kung fu in the day-to-day, the need for teachers to have a comprehensive mastery of the teaching situation, not only to eat through the teaching content, but also to thoroughly understand the student's learning situation, the two ends, teaching and learning will be better, forming a benign interaction, the exam will also be more in line with the reality.
