People's Daily commentator: the "14th Five-Year Plan" to achieve a good start - on learning and implementing the spirit of the Central Economic Work Conference - Xinhua
BEIJING, Dec. 11 (Xinhua) -- People's Daily December 12 commentator's article: â€œThe 14th Five-Year Planâ€ to achieve a good start â€“ on learning and implementing the spirit of the Central Economic Work Conference
â€œThe â€œFourteenth Five-Year Planâ€ â€œThe â€œFourteenth Five-Year Planâ€, the Central Economic Work Conference held from December 8 to 10 highly valued the achievements made in Chinaâ€TMs economic and social development
General Secretary Xi Jinping delivered an important speech at the meeting, profoundly summarized the economic work in 2021, in-depth analysis of the current economic situation, made a major deployment of economic work in 2022, provided us with good economic work in the next year's economic work, welcomed the convening of the party's 20 victories, and pointed out the way forward and provided fundamental follow.
We solemnly celebrate the centenary anniversary of the founding of the Communist Party of China, officially announce the comprehensive construction of a well-off society, the realization of the goal of the first hundred years of struggle, embark on an all-round construction of a socialist modern country, and enter a new journey towards the goal of the second centenary struggle.
We convened the Sixth Plenary Session of the 19th CPC Central Committee, summed up the major achievements and historical experiences of the party's hundred-year struggle, and adopted the third historical resolution in the history of the Centenary Party, the Resolution of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of the Communist Party of China on the major achievements and historical experience of the party's 100-year struggle, which is the political declaration of the Chinese Communists in the new era to keep in mind their original mission, adhere to and develop socialism with Chinese characteristics.
In the past one year, the great changes that have not occurred in the world in the past 100 years and the global pandemic of the new crown pneumonia epidemic are intertwined, the external environment has become more complex and severe, and the tasks of the prevention and control of the new crown pneumonia epidemic in China and economic and social development are extremely heavy and arduous.
With Comrade Xi Jinping as the core, the Party Central Committee insists on co-ordinating the two major situations at home and abroad, adhering to the general tone of steady progress, calmly responding to the 100-year-old changes and the century-long epidemic, co-ordinating epidemic prevention and control and economic and social development, accelerating the construction of a new development pattern, strengthening cross-cyclical adjustment of macroeconomic policies, focusing on promoting sustained and healthy economic development, focusing on deepening reform and innovation, and striving to complete the arduous tasks of reform and development.
The "14th Five-Year Plan" to achieve a good start, an important aspect is reflected in the construction of a new development pattern to take new steps, high-quality development to achieve new results.
China's economic development and epidemic prevention and control have maintained a leading position in the world, and the characteristics of strong development resilience, great potential, and sufficient power continue to appear; national strategic scientific and technological forces have been accelerated, major innovation achievements have sprung up, scientific and technological innovation capabilities have continued to improve, and key core technologies have achieved new breakthroughs; the resilience of the industrial chain has been improved, and the structure has continued to be optimized.
The achievement of these achievements is the result of the strong leadership of the Party Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping as the core, which is the result of Xi Jinping's ideological and scientific guidance for socialism with Chinese characteristics in the new era, and is the result of the people of all ethnic groups in the whole party and the whole country.
Practice has once again proved that the party has established the core position of Comrade Xi Jinping's Party Central Committee and the core position of the whole party, established the guiding position of Xi Jinping's socialist ideology with Chinese characteristics in the new era, which is of decisive significance to the development of the cause of the party and the state in the new era and to the historical process of promoting the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation.
With General Secretary Xi Jinping as the core of the Party's Central Committee and the core of the whole party at the helm, with Xi Jinping's ideological and scientific guidance on socialism with Chinese characteristics in the new era, and the unity and tenacious struggle of the people of all ethnic groups in the whole party and the whole country, we will surely be able to overcome all kinds of difficulties and obstacles, create a new era in the new journey of building a socialist modern country in an all-round way.
It will hold the 20th Party Congress next year, which is a major event in the political life of the party and the state.
Carry forward the spirit of great party building, adhering to the general tone of steady progress, implementing the new development concept in a complete, accurate and comprehensive manner, accelerating the construction of a new development pattern, comprehensively deepening reform and opening up, adhering to innovation-driven development, promoting high-quality development, adhering to supply-side structural reform as the main line, co-ordinating epidemic prevention and control and economic and social development, co-ordinating development and security, continue to do a good job of "six stability" and "six guarantees".
Let us more closely unite around the Party Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping as the core, enhance the â€œfour consciousnessesâ€, â€œfour self-confidencesâ€ and â€œtwo maintenancesâ€, continuously improve political judgment, political understanding, and political execution, put the decision-making deployment of the Party Central Committee into place with practical actions, and continuously push forward the cause of socialism with Chinese characteristics in the new era.
