Educational information: Beijing compresses the proportion of middle and high school students at the beginning of 2016 - Xinhua.com
On the 21st and the 22nd of the two days, Beijing junior high school entrance examination work was uniformly organized and implemented by various district education committees.
This year, all districts in Beijing have reduced the proportion of special student enrollments, and the competition for special students has become more intense.
Taking Dongcheng District as an example, this year, the proportion of primary and junior high school students in the district does not exceed 5% of the enrollment plan of the whole district, and the planned enrollment rate is 380, and the proportion of schools does not exceed 10% of the number of school enrollment plans.
All students with sports, arts, science and technology specialties and online enrollment are eligible to participate in the special student entrance examination.
In order to make it easy for students to participate in the nearby entrance examination, Dongcheng continued last year's examination and arrangement, with 1-2 examination sites in each school district, with a total of 13 examination sites.
The test points are divided according to the test area, divided into hours as a unit of time, the same day, the students will enter the test site in different examination areas in the examination area on the same day.
On May 23, the district education admissions examination center online publicized the list of students who passed the examination, and students can check the test results online.
