President of the Olympic Committee of Bosnia and Herzegovina: firmly believe that China has the ability to organize the Winter Olympics in a special period
BEIJING, Dec. 11 (Xinhua) -- The President of the Olympic Committee of Bosnia and Herzegovina said recently that the Polish side is looking forward to the Beijing Winter Olympics and firmly believes that China has the ability to organize the Winter Olympics in a special period.
A few days ago, China's Chinese Ambassador to Bosnia and Herzegovina Ji Ping met with the President of the Bosnia and Herzegovina Olympic Committee at the Sarajevo Olympic Center.
At the time of the meeting, Kevesic commented positively on Bosnia-China relations and said that when he visited China on the occasion of the 2008 Beijing Summer Olympics, he was very impressed by China's excellent organizational work and firmly believed that China has the ability to hold the Winter Olympics in a special period of time.
Ji Ping said that the two countries have a special "Olympic bond".
In the second two months, the 2022 Beijing Winter Olympics will also kick off, which will present a simple, safe and wonderful event to the world.
Looking forward to the deepening of exchanges and cooperation between the two countries in the preparation of winter sports events and the training of athletes, the Chinese Embassy in Bosnia and Herzegovina is willing to continue to play a role as a bridge, taking the Beijing Winter Olympics as an opportunity to promote the deepening of people-to-people and cultural exchanges between the two countries, so that the people of the two countries can "go to the future together", and wish the sports athletes of Bosnia and Herzegovina good results in Beijing.
Prior to the meeting, the Olympic Committee of Bosnia and Herzegovina held the award ceremony of the 10th Best Athletes of the Year, and Ji Ping, as a special guest, presented the best young athletes in Bosnia and Herzegovina.
At the event, the promotional video of the Beijing Winter Olympics was broadcast.
