48 hours of negative nucleic acid, the establishment of a "buffer zone" The State Council's joint prevention and control mechanism issued a document calling for the strengthening of epidemic prevention and control in port cities
BEIJING, Dec. 11 (Xinhua) -- The joint prevention and control mechanism of the State Council recently issued a notice to strengthen the prevention and control of the new crown pneumonia epidemic in port cities, requiring people who have recently left land border port cities (except those connected with ports in Hong Kong and Macao) to hold a negative nucleic acid test certificate within 48 hours.
According to the notice, the time range of the above requirements is from the date when the provinces, regions and cities determine the scope of the port city and announce it until March 15, 2022.
In addition, the notice also proposes that conditional port cities can study the establishment of epidemic prevention and control buffer zones within the jurisdiction.
The relevant person in charge of the disease prevention and control bureau of the National Health and Health Commission introduced that for some port cities, cross-border border trade is the main pillar of the local economy, and the border people on both sides have frequent exchanges.
The implementation of zoning differentiated management policy, from a prevention and control spillage defense line into two lines of defense, is expected to achieve threshold forward, reduce the risk of spillover of the epidemic, with the minimum social impact, the lowest social cost to achieve the maximum effectiveness of epidemic prevention and control.
Recently, there have been a number of local agglomeration epidemics in our country, all of which have been imported through port cities.
The above-mentioned notice pointed out that this shows that some local epidemic monitoring and early warning is not timely, the closed-loop management of high-risk post personnel is not implemented, regular nucleic acid detection is flowing in the form, all aspects of cold-chain items are not in place, the management of centralized isolation sites is not standardized, and the emergency response to the epidemic is not scientific and accurate.
According to the notice, we should focus on improving the epidemic prevention and control mechanism of port cities, improving the epidemic monitoring and early warning system, and implementing border control and control measures to speed up the shortcomings and weaknesses of port city prevention and control, unrelenting, scientific and accurate prevention and control work, and knitting the external defense input defense line.
The notice emphasized that all port cities should simultaneously study and deploy epidemic prevention and control with people's livelihood protection, announce and unblock people's livelihood security hotlines, regularly investigate hidden hidden dangers such as the supply of basic living materials and prices, and solve and actively respond to the outstanding problems reflected by the masses in a timely manner.
According to the notice, the port cities referred to therein include open land routes, waterways, and air ports in the counties (cities, districts, flags), the cities (territories, states, alliances) and the municipality in which they are located, and the specific scope shall be determined by the provinces (autonomous regions and municipalities directly under the Central Government) in accordance with the needs of epidemic prevention and control and announced in a timely manner.
