I went to a lot of milk powder manufacturers and came into contact with a lot of milk powder production lines.
In fact, their raw materials are exactly the same as those that are bagged, and there is no difference.
So everyone will definitely ask: Why is the shelf life of the bag is one year, and the shelf life is two years or longer?
Or ask again: Why is the price difference between listening and bagging so large?
In fact, a lot of consumers from this point of view, or at the mother's level, believe that the quality will be much better because the raw materials are not the same.
In fact, the raw materials are the same, but everyone thinks expensive is good.
There are also consumers out of this state of mind after eating the reaction also said that the taste or taste is not the same!
