Why is the difference between their raw materials so great?
Because most manufacturers at the time of the pricing are taken into account that if the bag pricing is too high, it is difficult for consumers to accept, which means that the profits generated by the manufacturers are very low, or there is no profit, what does the manufacturer rely on to survive?
Therefore, they have a large increase in the pricing of listening clothes to protect their profit margins.
Therefore, most of the manufacturers mainly promote listening, rather than bags.
And do you think there are so many manufacturers in the annual advertising costs of tens of millions or even hundreds of millions, where is the cost?
You can all imagine.
Then with the development of the society, the promotion costs of the market, such as the promotion staff of the shopping mall, the display costs of the mall, the cost of gifts of the product, and the cost of advertising are also constantly increasing.
Therefore, various manufacturers are also constantly adding new products, and listening, the price is constantly rising, in fact, with the increase of market costs and new products.
The main purpose is to obtain a higher profit, in fact, their raw materials to increase the cost of not more than 3 or 4 yuan.
Another part of the brand, in order to promote their own products, unscrupulous means, linked to the doctor of the hospital, by them to assist in the promotion of the product, from a listen to the profit ranging from 30 yuan to 80 yuan.
China's relevant laws absolutely do not allow such a method of operation, in fact, this practice is harming consumers.
It is recommended that under the premise of having cans at home to buy bagged milk powder into the tank, which can save costs, and increase the preservation and sealing of milk powder, there will be no impact on children.
