Is the throb soaking feet a leak?
Choosing the right foot tub can play a very good pedicure health care role, and today's U.S. small series will answer this question, hoping to be helpful to friends.
With the enhancement of people's awareness of health care, foot tubs are more and more loved by consumers, and a large number of different products have emerged in the market, ranging from more than one hundred yuan to a thousand yuan, giving consumers a lot of room for choice.
On the surface of the relevant data, compared with the traditional household appliances, the sales of health appliances such as foot tubs are popular, but there are no special industry standards, so there are certain safety hazards.
It’s too dangerous to soak your feet in electric water.”
Mr. Li told reporters that recently, he bought a bidet to his father as a birthday gift, but when his father soaked his feet, he felt that the soles of his feet were tingled.
At the beginning, Mr. Li thought that it was caused by the vibrating function of the bidet, he did not expect to turn off the vibration function, and his father still felt hemp on the soles of his feet.
Mr. Li gave a test, the pen was actually bright, and Mr. Li was surprised to find that the water in the bidet was actually electrified.
Later, he contacted the business, the attitude of the business is not bad, despite the removal of the bidet, Mr. Li is still unhappy.
Because he found that the long-popular bidet now does not have a clear and detailed industry regulations on the setting of the highest temperature, what kinds of people are used, and what kind of materials are guaranteed to be harmless.
However, under normal circumstances, there will be no charging problem, but it does not rule out that a small number of products are not strictly checked when leaving the factory.
Therefore, in the purchase at the time of the choice of split-type bidet.
