Hunan Daily, December 10 (all-media reporter Zhang Shangwu Hu Pangping Correspondent Liu Xiaoling) This morning, the 13th Hunan Tea Expo and Xinhua black tea promotion will be held at the Hunan International Convention and Exhibition Center to showcase the tea industry, innovate tea science and technology, carry forward the tea culture, and accelerate the goal of sprinting hundreds of billions of tea industry.
