In recent years, the provincial Party committee and the provincial government have strongly supported the development of the tea industry, promoted the construction of the 100 billion Xiang tea industry, and formed the development pattern of “Sanxiang Four Water Color Tea”.
The tea industry in the province to increase innovation, green tea, black tea, black tea and other major tea rotation, the main tea area to promote the integration of tea brigades, driving the vast number of tea farmers to increase income.
