At the opening ceremony, the provincial leaders for the fourth batch of enterprises authorized to use the "Hunan black tea" trademark for the licensing, Xinhua to promote the "source of lake red".
In the new black tea exhibition hall, Fujian tea merchants look at an alpine tea called "ice spring" and immediately placed an order.
