Microfluidic chip cover plate for PC material, please do not enter the solvent chemical reaction with the PC.
Do not use the push syringe directly to enter the chip, otherwise it is prone to leakage.
Microfluidic chips of ordinary substrates pass pure water testing at 500 mbar (100um channel depth) or 300 mbar (50 um channel depth) prior to shipment.
The glass basal chips pass the pure water test according to the injection pressure of 800 mbar (100um channel) before shipment, and be careful not to collide with the sharp object during the use of the glass substrate chip, otherwise it will damage the substrate.
In the course of use, please consider the viscosity of the solution and do not exceed this range, otherwise it will cause leakage.
Under the condition that the ordinary substrate microfluidic micro-chip uses a pure water injection pump, we give you the recommended flow velocity of less than 150ul/min, and the oil-phase velocity is recommended to be set below 50ul/min.
Depending on the viscosity of the actual input liquid, increase your velocity parameter value from slow to fast.
After the general-purpose chip is completed in the experiment, please clean the inner channel in a timely manner, otherwise it is easy to cause blockage.
Microfluidic chips are consumables and cannot be reused for a long period of time.
If due to long-term use or improper operation, the damage to the chip will not be refunded.
If you need a microfluidic chip that can withstand greater pressure or velocity, you can contact customer service for customization.
