So what is a normal public opinion?
Random selection of the three hot search: February two dragon heads up, good friend price increases, cargo pull incident, public opinion spreads to form a crest, and then [exponential decline] (smooth curve) finally dissipated, if there is a secondary public opinion there will be a small hump again.
They seem to be the same as the "network public opinion evolution model" once displayed by the official website.
What’s an anomalous public opinion?
Randomly selected six hot searches in the same event, showing [lonely peaks], [alias], [broken fictitious].
[Solitary peak shape] That is, man-made heating, quickly rushed into the hot search, causing public attention; [aliasing] that is, periodic heating, to ensure that the topic on the hot search list; [comprehensive cliff-like] is the collective evacuation, the hot search to play the "function", received new tasks, rushed to a new battlefield.
In Figure 9, the thermal peak of one event happens to be the trough of the other event, the time is not bad, it must be a unified batch of marines to receive the task to open a new round of offensive.
The specialization of black public relations can be seen: dozens of hot searches are on the list at the same time, which attract attention, which are responsible for popular science, which are responsible for leading the battle, which shifts the line of sight, what influences cognition, which misleads judgment, which incites emotions, and which block decision-making, black production accounts are divided into batches and sub-nodes, and almost all the elements are taken into account in the diffusion of public opinion.
Communication is a science, putting aside all the subjective factors of positions and emotions, only from the objective data, black public relations will have nowhere to hide.
Every time we walk, we will leave such traces, and we will dig them out together.
The data source: hot search time machine.
For the first time in countries such as Mauritius, cases of Omikjon strain infection have been detected - Xinhua
BEIJING, Dec. 12 (Xinhua) -- Mauritius, Cyprus and Malawi recently reported for the first time that cases of infection with the Omikjung strain of the new mutant coronavirus have been reported.
On the 10th, Mauritius first reported two cases of the Omikjon strain infection in the country.
According to the Minister of Health of the Ministry of Mauslas Jagutpal, an infected person is a tourist who arrived in Mauritius from South Africa on November 27; the other is a local resident of Mauritius who tested positive for nucleic acid on November 30 after coming into contact with a person who has recently returned to South Africa.
After hospital isolation and treatment, the nucleic acid test results of the two infected people turned negative, and have now returned to their respective places of residence.
On the 10th, the Ministry of Health of Cyprus announced the first confirmed three cases of the Omikjon strain in the country.
All three were students who returned from a trip abroad earlier this month and were not admitted to the hospital due to their mild illness.
In order to prevent the spread of the Omikjon strain, the Cypriot government continues to increase prevention and control efforts.
From December 6th to January 10th next year, passengers over the age of 12 who enter by plane will be required to undergo nucleic acid testing at the airport at their own expense.
On the 10th, the Ministry of Health also announced that it will vaccinate children between the ages of 5 and 11 in the Pfizer new crown vaccine in the country.
Malawi's Minister of Health, Kunbizer Chiponda, said on the 9th that the first three cases of the Omikjon strain have been detected in the country.
The country's health department sequenced the genomes of 12 new crown-positive samples taken between November 9 and December 2, and found these three cases of infection.
