Small Umbrella for insurance, is it reliable?
Small Umbrella is an insurance brokerage platform for the Internet.
Judging from the setting conditions: according to the "Regulatory Provisions on Insurance Brokerage Institutions (Revised in 2015)", to become an insurance brokerage company, it must meet three key words: shareholders and promoters have no major illegal records in the past three years, the minimum amount of RMB 50 million can only be established, and they must be approved by the China Insurance Regulatory Commission.
In fact, these three are very demanding, summed up is to have the strength, to go through the CBRC (regulatory of insurance companies, banks in the country's authoritative department approval), shareholders to have a good style, as an insurance brokerage company's small Umbrella Insurance, policyholders do not need too much to question whether the small umbrella insurance is formal or not, after all, there are these three thresholds, not what insurance companies can achieve.
That’s fine, it’s trustworthy.
From the point of view of insurance products: small Umbrella insurance is an insurance supermarket, many of the company's star serious illness insurance is sold on this platform, such as the latest on the shelf and the Thai Super Mary No. 5 serious illness insurance, the claimor and the insurer are with Thai life, small umbrella insurance is only a third-party intermediary, do not have to question its popularity.
From the point of view of the payment model: the products of the Internet platform, due to the lack of operating expenses of business outlets and the cost of workers' wages, the Internet products are generally more cost-effective, and the payment method is flexible to support monthly payments, reduce the payment pressure of policyholders, and at the same time can maximize the leverage of insurance.
It's still very good.
It can be taken into account.
Judging from the professionalism of the salesman: this is particularly important, because insurance is a very strong professional requirements of the industry, a lot of Internet product customers can insure themselves, there will be a lot of misunderstanding, in terms of health notification and occupation, non-insured practitioners will often add their subjective awareness at the time of insurance, feel that they are healthy or compatible, so it is easy to have a lot of claims hidden dangers, may be the risk of being rejected.
I myself in the "Tencent micro-guarantee" (like a small umbrella, is also an Internet insurance brokerage platform) have done insurance phone sales, very responsible to tell everyone.
The insurance of the Internet is true, it is also reliable, it does not depend on people, there are no professional practitioners in Internet channels, and there are a lot of misleading sales.
For example: 1 yuan insurance insurance 6 million, buy insurance to send a mobile phone, free to receive 60,000 serious illness insurance, these marketing strategies are not wrong, but it does not take the heavy light, will not tell the policyholder, the first month 1 yuan, the next month is the need according to the normal charges, ranging from dozens to 200, a lot of customers with a fee of one or two years to buy what is not clear.
I think you can spend a dollar, and the insurance company will lose 6 million (the pie in the world).
The free delivery of the mobile phone is sent by the policy tail number such as 6666, 8888 such a special policy number, and if the winning text message is issued, they will not be redeemed, and no one will be reminded.
(This is also a pit for policyholders) free of charge 60,000 serious illness insurance, is a short-term, if relying only on this, there is no other commercial insurance, in case there is a real serious illness, what to do, can not solve the problem, the later life began to run naked.
At present, the country is also cracking down on the misguided sales of Internet insurance.
So comprehensive, there are no problems in the platform, there is no problem with the product, and the problem is the professionalism and professional ethics of the salesman.
In fact, the products of many offline insurance brokerage companies are more extensive, customers can choose more opportunities and more products, and the cost performance of some products is also better than that of Internet products.
I myself have helped 59 Internet customers, underwrite offline products, and save 2000-3000 yuan per person per year.
If you have any questions, you are welcome to communicate and communicate with me.
I: Mingya insurance broker, has 3 years of enterprise management training experience, serving nearly a thousand enterprise users, cooperation with more than 100 insurance companies, before insurance, I will start from the customer's needs, tailor-made insurance products for the customer, insurance, for the customer's goods, try to win the best insurance results for the customer, after the insurance, for the customer to do the policy finishing, policy hosting, so that customers can rest assured.
Lifelong growth with every client.
I hope that my answer will be helpful!
According to the definition of the insurance regulatory department, Internet insurance is the insurance business in which the policyholder can independently complete all the insurance processes after clicking on the insurance link.
In this process, the insured person does not need to sign, the insurance consultant does not need to sign, and all the steps can be independently completed by the policyholder.
Although there is not much "ceremonial sense" of Internet insurance, it may not even have a printed paper contract, but this does not in any way affect the validity and legal effect of the electronic version of the contract.
This model is somewhat similar to "telephone sales" general assembly line operations, but there will also be a fatal problem to purchase insurance, that is, follow-up services may not keep up.
Insurance is usually a long-term contract for up to a few decades, when we buy insurance, should we seriously consider whether the "intermediary" we have chosen is an "insurance intermediary" who can accompany us for a long time and will also provide services for many years?
