As a girl, I can no longer be silent.
After the news of my police was uploaded, you did not converge at all, but became more and more arrogant.
I don't care what kind of political background you are, no matter what kind of status you are, in our society, it needs the respect of both sexes.
Yes, you can continue this kind of poignant, cryptic, humiliating, abusive speech, you can also continue to say that you just love and pay attention to me, you can continue to think that this is not harassment, and you can even continue to deny that it is not a picture you made, or continue to make all offensive remarks.
