Vietnamese Prime Minister Pham Minh attends the 3rd Vietnam National Digital Technology Enterprise Development Forum
Two major meetings were held on the sidelines of the 3rd National Forum on the Development of Digital Technology Enterprises in Việt, focusing on the theme of digital technology enterprises and national digital transformation, digital technology enterprises and economic recovery and development after the new crown pneumonia epidemic.
Minister of Communications and Communications Nguyen Meng Hung said that in 2021, despite the continuous spread of the new crown pneumonia epidemic, the number and operating income of Vietnam's digital technology enterprises continued to grow, reaching nearly 10%.
In 2021, Vietnam's typical number of digital products has focused on solving the major problems faced by Vietnam, and many digital products have gone out of the country, and Vietnam's digital technology ranking has been improved.
He called on digital technology enterprises to assume responsibility for the development of national digital transformation platforms and assume the task of developing these national digital transformation platforms.
At the forum, the leaders of various departments and state agencies are studying, developing, applying and transferring digital technology enterprises, organizations and individuals to share and pool the resources of the entire society to develop Vietnamese technology enterprises, and work together to promote the country's digital transformation and economic recovery after the epidemic.
In his speech at the forum, Prime Minister Fan Mingzheng stressed that digital transformation is the only way in the world and an objective need for development.
Digital transformation has become a global problem, and digital transformation serves the whole people, so it is necessary to mobilize the participation of the whole people.
The people and enterprises are the core, the main body, the goal and the driving force of digital transformation.
Therefore, all policies must be for the people and enterprises.
Prime Minister Fan Mingzheng stressed that the digital transformation needs to reflect the spirit of the nation, it is necessary to focus on internal, strategic, long-term and decisive factors, and external power is an important and a breakthrough.
At the same time, he also believes that digital transformation needs to drive in-depth development and sustainable development, participate in the prevention and control, economic recovery and development of the new crown pneumonia epidemic, respond to subsequent changes, overcome the depletion of natural resources, and contribute to green transformation and the development of green energy.
Digital transformation needs to participate in the establishment of databases to protect and carry forward the cultural values, historical traditions and national customs of relevant countries, and to promote the digital transformation of banking, taxation, land management and development of databases, as well as logistics.
The biggest goal of digital transformation is to make the people happier, and the country is increasingly prosperous.
Prime Minister Fan Mingzheng called on governments at all levels, organs and enterprises at all levels to increase leadership and guidance in the development of digital technology, raise awareness of digital transformation, continue to formulate and improve the system of digital transformation, strengthen national management and promote the development of digital technology enterprises in the spirit of respect, communication, listening, and initiative.
