"Intelligent Xiaoxiang" 2021 China international rail transit and equipment manufacturing industry talent summit opened - Rolling News - Hunan Daily Network - Huasheng Online
Hunan Daily on December 10th (all-media reporter Zhou Jianheng) On the 9th, the 2021 China International Rail Transit and Equipment Manufacturing Industry Talent Summit was opened in Zhuzhou.
Wang Cheng, the Standing Committee of the Provincial Party Committee and the Director of the Organization Department of the Provincial Party Committee, attended the launch ceremony and spoke.
Wang Cheng pointed out that holding the talent summit is an important measure to implement the spirit of the central talent work conference and the provincial 12th Party Congress, which shows the sincerity of Hunan's emphasis on talents, thirst for talents, and make good use of talents.
Hunan's excellent tradition of knowledge and talents, a broad platform to help the development of talents, the environmental conditions to achieve a better life, in recent years, the in-depth implementation of the talent-led development strategy, with the Furong talent action plan as the traction, the construction of breeding and retaining the whole chain of talent work pattern, has become a fertile ground for talent growth and achievements, a fertile land for innovation and entrepreneurship.
At present, Hunan is fully implementing the strategic positioning and mission tasks of the "three highs and four new ones", which will further open the door to talents, introduce better policies, concentrate more resources and create better conditions for talent innovation and entrepreneurship, and look forward to outstanding talents from all walks of life working together to gather wisdom for Hunan's high-quality development.
The event site set up Changsha, Zhuzhou, Xiangtan exhibition hall and Hunan free trade zone exhibition hall, the Provincial Department of Science and Technology, the Provincial Department of Science and Technology, the Provincial Department of Science and Technology, the Provincial Department of Human Resources and Social Affairs released the list of key needs for scientific and technological innovation of advanced manufacturing-related industries, the catalogue of talent needs of the intelligent manufacturing industry in the post-doctoral mobile station.
48 large-scale enterprises, such as China's car, Zhongzhong and Yuanda Science and Technology, nearly 1,000 recent graduates and social talents have participated in the docking of talent projects.
