Yangtze River dry stream to achieve full coverage of water green comprehensive service area - Xinhua
Xinhua News Agency, Wuhan, December 11 (Reporter Wang Xian) Chongqing Fuling water green comprehensive service area was completed and put into operation as scheduled on the 10th, which is the 2nd water green integrated service area officially operated in the upper reaches of the Yangtze River after the listing and operation of the Luzhou water green comprehensive service area on the 8th.
At this point, the water green comprehensive service area has covered the upper, middle and lower reaches of the Yangtze River.
Qiu Jianhua, deputy director of the Jiang Aviation Administration of the Ministry of Transport, said that previously, Hubei, Hunan, Jiangxi, Anhui, Jiangsu and other provinces have built and operated 10 water green comprehensive service areas in the middle and lower reaches of the Yangtze River, which has been recognized by the vast number of crew members and has played an important role in promoting the high-quality development of Yangtze River shipping.
The full coverage of the water green comprehensive service area is another milestone event in the construction of green shipping in the Yangtze River, and the ability to receive pollutant pollutants and shipping services in the Yangtze River has been significantly improved.
According to reports, the water green comprehensive service area is an important facility to provide all-round production and living services for the vast number of ships and crews to help the vast number of crew members to solve the "distress" problem.
The completion and operation of the upper reaches of the Yangtze River two green comprehensive service area, set life services, production services and government services as one, with the theme of green environmental protection, ship maintenance and ship emergency rescue services as the characteristics, the realization of ships in Hong Kong "one-time berth, a number of services", will make perennial sailing in the Yangtze River crew work more efficient, life more convenient.
U.S.-Companies massing the most powerful weapons around China's rare visit to Guam 2022-01-17 multi-dimensional pro-China media multi-faceted reports: the latest U.S. satellite images show that three U.S. aircraft carriers are regrouping around China; U.S. media also disclosed that one of the most powerful weapons in the U.S. Navy's arsenal made a rare visit to Guam, sending an important signal to U.S. allies and adversaries in the Indo-Pacific region.
According to the Chinese think tank "South China Sea strategic situational awareness platform", on January 9, the satellite discovered the USS Carl Vinson aircraft carrier near the Barabach Strait.
The Barabach Strait, which connects the South China Sea and the Sulu Sea, is a strategic location on the first island chain in the western Pacific Ocean.
It is expected that the Carl Vinson will be deployed in the South China Sea.
This is the "Carl Vinson" aircraft carrier for the first time equipped with F-35C fighters and CMV-22 "Osprey" carrier-based transport aircraft for deployment.
The U.S. aircraft carrier, which is now squabbling in the upper reaches of the U.S. Pacific Ocean, in addition to Carl Vinson, and the USS Abraham Lincoln, which sailed from the United States on January 3.
For the first time, the USS Lincoln also carried the F-35C carrier-based squadron, which is part of the U.S. Marine Corps’ 314th Fighter Attack Squadron.
In addition to the above two aircraft carriers, the U.S. Navy is currently deployed in the Asia-Pacific region with the USS Ronald Reagan in Yokosuka, Japan.
The aircraft carrier battle group also includes the guided-missile cruiser Champlain and the guided-missile destroyer Stockdar.
On January 17, 2022, the "South China Sea strategic situational awareness platform" released the latest satellite images, showing that the three U.S. military aircraft carriers are gathering around China.
U.S. aircraft carriers a rare visit to Guam on January 17, 2022, U.S. carrier-carrying carrier CMV-22B flight route.
According to CNN on January 17, one of the most powerful weapons in the U.S. Navy's arsenal made a rare visit to Guam last weekend.
The Ohio-class nuclear submarine USS Nevada, carrying 20 Trident ballistic missiles and dozens of nuclear warheads, entered the U.S. naval base in Guam on Saturday.
The U.S. three aircraft carriers are a rare visit to Guam with the most powerful weapons around the U.S. aircraft that sends a signal to allies and foes in an increasingly tense Indo-Pacific region.
It’s the first time a U.S. ballistic missile submarine has visited Guam since 2016 and it’s its second public visit since the 1980’s.
The U.S. three aircraft carriers are massing the most powerful weapons around China's rare visit to Guam China has built a large number of military facilities in the Spratly Islands in recent years.
Pictured is China's Perpetual Island in the Spratly Spratly Islands.
The U.S. Navy said in a statement that the U.S.A.-class Nevada’s visit to Guam strengthens cooperation between the U.S. and its allies in the region, demonstrating U.S. capabilities, flexibility, readiness, and continued commitment to U.S. security and stability in the Indo-Pacific region.
A ballistic missile submarine is often referred to as a Boomer submarine.
The whereabouts of the U.S. Navy’s fleet of 14 Thunder Submarines are usually kept strictly confidential.
The secrecy surrounding ballistic missile submarines has made the “thundering submarine the most important survivable weapon in the nuclear triad,” which also includes silo ballistic missiles located on U.S. soil, as well as nuclear-tipped-carrying bombers such as B-2 and B-52.
Talking to a friend about the recent Meta fell 26% and the market value has evaporated by $251 billion, Zuckerberg's response to "unprecedented competition".
Meta (formerly Facebook) is actually an advertising company, the revenue mainly comes from advertising, today's money-making advertising company, itself has a traffic channel.
Facebook, Instagram, Whatsapp and so on, no matter what kind of functional positioning, are Meta's traffic channels.
Not only that, Meta is also the largest "advertising alliance", a large number of app external Meta's advertising, through Meta's advertising platform to achieve monetization.
However, the times have changed.
First, due to the adjustment of Apple's privacy policy, it is very difficult for Meta to get the user's data information, which affects the efficiency of advertising.
Apple's current privacy policy is very user-friendly, it will be obvious to remind the user whether to allow the app to get their own information, the normal reaction of most people is certainly not allowed.
Next, if Google swastified again, it will have an even greater impact on Meta's revenue.
Second, the Chinese factor in Meta’s previous revenue growth has also softened (it’s uncertain, but it’s).
Everyone usually knows that Meta has no business in China, but this understanding is not accurate.
At least 10% of Meta’s revenue comes from China each year, mainly from Chinese companies that contribute to maritime operations.
Meta's office in Hong Kong has about a few hundred people, and there are a number of major agents in the mainland.
Chinese companies want to expand in overseas markets, Meta is surrounded by advertising channels, and most of the burning money has been given to Meta.
It’s interesting to note that byte TT is now one of Meta’s main competitors, but in the past two years, Meta can make a lot of money from bytes.
Various domestic agents are helping Bytes go to Meta to invest in advertising, and Meta's performance in Greater China is also very good.
I didn’t know about it recently, but it certainly wasn’t better than before.
The stage of large-scale burning of money by Chinese companies overseas has passed.
Third, the expansion of new traffic channels is not smooth.
Facebook is getting older, and the new platform, including the TT, is not in Meta’s hands.
The biggest problem is not just a fall in revenue but a lack of growth expectations.
The capital market not only depends on the income, but more importantly depends on the expectations in the future.
It’s clear that Meta’s expectations aren’t enough.
In order to tell a new story to the market, Zuckerberg talked about the "metaverse".
The metaverse should indeed be one of the directions of the future, but the implementation cycle of the metaverse is relatively long, and this story should not be enough to support Meta's market capitalization in the past two or three years.
So the next two years, it should be a more difficult time for Meta.
Don't look at Facebook's very beautiful scenery now, there are 100 billion to 200 billion U.S. dollars of revenue every year, in fact, Facebook is now a very strong sense of crisis, compared with other Internet companies and high-tech companies, there is no safe moat.
Although a few of his social software is now relatively high in daily life, it is also a mainstream social software, such as Facebook, WhatsApp and so on, in the face of the rapid development of tiktok, Facebook does not have any confidence.
The unsatisfied concept of the meta-university has absolutely no hope of success in a short period of time, so Facebook is very dangerous, which is why Zuckerberg is changing the company's name and constantly looking for the root cause of finding a new track, but I think his track choice is the wrong choice, it is a non-returning point.
Article 17 The state implements a registered practice management system for the qualifications of registered fire protection engineers.
Those who have obtained the qualification certificate of first- and second-level registered fire-fighting engineers can practice in the name of the registered fire engineer at the corresponding level.
Article 18 The fire department of the Ministry of Public Security is the registration and approval department for the qualification of the first-level registered fire protection engineer.
The fire-fighting institutions of the public security organs of provinces, autonomous regions and municipalities directly under the Central Government shall be the registration and approval department for the second-level registered fire-fighting engineer, and shall be responsible for the preliminary examination of the qualification and registration of first-level registered fire-fighting engineers.
The person who obtained the qualification certificate and applied for the registration of fire protection engineers at the first or second level shall be employed in an approved fire-fighting technical service institution or key fire safety unit, and submit the registration application materials to the public security fire-fighting institution of the public security organ where the employing unit is located (the employing unit belongs to the enterprise, through the place of industrial and commercial registration).
Article 20 After receiving the applicant's application materials for registration by the fire-fighting institution of the public security organs of the province, the application materials are incomplete or does not conform to the statutory form, it shall, on the spot or within 5 working days, inform the applicant of the need to correct all the contents in a one-time manner, if they are not notified within the time limit, they shall be accepted from the date of receipt of the application materials.
For applications for registration that are accepted or inadmissible, they shall be issued with a special seal for the fire-fighting organs of the public security organs at the same level and the written certificate with an indication of the date.
Article 21 Within 20 working days from the date of acceptance of the application for registration, the fire-fighting institutions of provinces, autonomous regions and municipalities directly under the Central Government shall complete the preliminary examination of the first-level registered fire engineer's qualification application materials in accordance with the prescribed conditions and procedures, and the registration and approval of the qualifications of the second-level registered fire engineers shall be reported to the Fire Department of the Ministry of Public Security for approval.
The fire department of the Ministry of Public Security shall, from the date of receipt of the application materials and preliminary examination opinions submitted by the fire-fighting institution of the provincial-level public security organs, make a decision on whether to approve it within 20 working days.
If the approval decision cannot be made within the prescribed time limit, the extension shall be communicated to the applicant.
Where a decision not to be approved is made, the reasons shall be explained in writing, and the applicant shall be informed of its right to apply for administrative reconsideration in accordance with the law or to initiate an administrative lawsuit.
The registration and approval department shall, within 10 working days from the date of making the approval decision, issue and serve the registration certificate at the appropriate level.
Article 23 Each registration certificate is valid for three years.
During the validity period, the registration certificate is the practice certificate of the registered fire protection engineer at the corresponding level, which is stored and used by the registered fire protection engineer himself.
Article 24 An application for initial registration shall apply within one year from the date of obtaining the qualification certificate for the first and second-level registered fire protection engineers.
Late applications for initial registration must comply with the requirements for continuing education under these regulations.
The specific measures of registration management such as initial registration, continuous registration, change registration, cancellation of registration and non-registration shall be separately stipulated by the Ministry of Public Security.
Article 25 Continuing education is a necessary condition for the continuous registration, re-registration and overdue initial registration of registered fire engineers.
During the validity period of each registration, registered fire protection engineers at all levels should complete the corresponding continuing education in accordance with the regulations.
Article 26 The registration and approval department shall, in a timely manner, announce to the public the registration of fire protection engineers, establish an integrity file of registered fire engineers, and implement credit management for their practicing activities.
Article 27 The registered management department for the qualifications of registered fire protection engineers at all levels shall strictly implement the relevant provisions of the Administrative Licensing Law of the People's Republic of China.
